cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TokEval: intrinsic evaluation metrics for tokenizers"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit for computing intrinsic quality metrics for tokenizers across
  natural language, code, and math: compression, fertility, vocabulary
  utilization, information-theoretic measures, digit and operator handling,
  code AST boundary alignment, UTF-8 integrity, reconstruction fidelity, and
  cross-lingual fairness.
type: software
authors:
